{"id":41,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 2559 lines, 150137 bytes --\n185 |     · -- Both false\n186 |       omega\n187 | \n188 | /--\n189 | The set of lattice sites with positive signed time (strictly positive).\n190 | -/\n191 | noncomputable def positiveSites (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] : Finset (PeriodicSite T L) :=\n192 |   Finset.filter (λ n => signedTime T n.time > 0) Finset.univ\n193 | \n194 | /--\n195 | The set of lattice sites with negative signed time.\n196 | -/\n197 | noncomputable def negativeSites (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] : Finset (PeriodicSite T L) :=\n198 |   Finset.filter (λ n => signedTime T n.time < 0) Finset.univ\n199 | \n200 | /--\n201 | The set of lattice sites at the time interface (signed time = 0).\n202 | -/\n203 | noncomputable def interfaceSites (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] : Finset (PeriodicSite T L) :=\n204 |   Finset.filter (λ n => signedTime T n.time = 0) Finset.univ\n205 | \n206 | /-- The signed time of a reflected site is the negation of the original. -/\n207 | lemma signedTime_reflectSite {T L : ℕ} [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (hT : Odd T)\n208 |     (n : PeriodicSite T L) :\n209 |     signedTime T (ReflectSite.reflectSite n).time = -signedTime T n.time := by\n210 |   simp [ReflectSite.reflectSite, reflectSitePeriodic, signedTime_neg T n.time hT]\n211 | \n212 | /-- Reflection maps positive-time sites to negative-time sites. -/\n213 | lemma reflectSite_mem_negative_of_positive {T L : ℕ} [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (hT : Odd T)\n214 |     {n : PeriodicSite T L} (hn : n ∈ positiveSites T L) :\n215 |     ReflectSite.reflectSite n ∈ negativeSites T L := by\n216 |   have h_signed : signedTime T n.time > 0 := by\n217 |     simpa [positiveSites, Finset.mem_filter] using hn\n218 |   have h_neg_signed : signedTime T (ReflectSite.reflectSite n).time < 0 := by\n219 |     rw [signedTime_reflectSite hT n]; linarith\n220 |   simpa [negativeSites, Finset.mem_filter] using h_neg_signed\n221 | \n222 | /-- Reflection maps interface sites to interface sites. -/\n223 | lemma reflectSite_mem_interface_of_interface {T L : ℕ} [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (hT : Odd T)\n224 |     {n : PeriodicSite T L} (hn : n ∈ interfaceSites T L) :\n225 |     ReflectSite.reflectSite n ∈ interfaceSites T L := by\n226 |   have h_signed : signedTime T n.time = 0 := by\n227 |     simpa [interfaceSites, Finset.mem_filter] using hn\n228 |   have h_int_signed : signedTime T (ReflectSite.reflectSite n).time = 0 := by\n229 |     rw [signedTime_reflectSite hT n, h_signed]; simp\n230 |   simpa [interfaceSites, Finset.mem_filter] using h_int_signed\n231 | \n232 | /-- Reflection does not map interface sites to positive sites. -/\n233 | lemma reflectSite_not_mem_positive_of_interface {T L : ℕ} [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (hT : Odd T)\n234 |     {n : PeriodicSite T L} (hn : n ∈ interfaceSites T L) :\n\n... 2325 more line(s) below (use offset=235 to continue reading)\nTime: 2026-08-05 05:40:16 UTC","timestamp":1785908416,"token_count":899,"tool_call_id":"d6261375-149d-4b3f-87b0-9a0391bc3cc2","full_token_estimate":611,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":2559,"byte_count":150137,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":21,"is_prune_marker":false}
