wilsonActionOSInterface (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n456 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) : ℝ :=\n457 |   ∑ n : PeriodicSite T L, ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4,\n458 |     if ¬ (signedTime T n.time > 0 ∧ signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ).time > 0 ∧\n459 |           signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ) ν).time > 0 ∧\n460 |           signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n ν).time > 0) ∧\n461 |        ¬ (signedTime T n.time < 0 ∧ signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ).time < 0 ∧\n462 |           signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ) ν).time < 0 ∧\n463 |           signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n ν).time < 0) then\n464 |       plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν\n465 |     else 0\n466 | \n467 | /--\n468 | For each oriented plaquette (n; μ, ν), exactly one of the three conditions holds:\n469 | positive (all corners > 0), negative (all corners < 0), or interface (the rest).\n470 | -/\n471 | lemma plaquette_classification (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] (n : PeriodicSite T L) (μ ν : Fin 4) :\n472 |     (signedTime T n.time > 0 ∧ signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ).time > 0 ∧\n473 |      signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L (addVectorPeriodic T L n μ) ν).time > 0 ∧\n474 |      signedTime T (addVectorPeriodic T L n ν).time > 0) ∨\n\n... 2085 more line(s) below (use offset=475 to continue reading)\nTime: 2026-08-05 05:40:17 UTC","timestamp":1785908417,"token_count":1038,"tool_call_id":"eae388b8-b572-4d95-bb86-032e32945282","full_token_estimate":715,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":2559,"byte_count":150137,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":21,"is_prune_marker":false}
